     * Otherwise, the paths will be joined, normalized and returned.
     * </p>
     * <p>
     * The output will be the same on both Unix and Windows except
     * for the separator character.
     * </p>
     * <pre>
     * /foo/      + bar        --&gt;  /foo/bar
     * /foo       + bar        --&gt;  /foo/bar
